<heading>joins groups - List groups for an account.</heading>

<rule/>

<heading level="2">
Usage
</heading>

<pre>
  groups ACCOUNT
</pre>

<heading level="2">
Description
</heading>

<paragraph>
Lists all groups that an account belongs to.
</paragraph>

<heading level="2">
Examples
</heading>

<pre>
groups admin
  List all groups the admin account is a member of.
</pre>

<heading level="2">
See also
</heading>

<paragraph>
add, remove, users
</paragraph>
